WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.795
Day 9. The Whole Alphabet.

2
00:00:02.245 --> 00:00:09.057
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.557 --> 00:00:13.722
Say the alphabet together, slowly, pointing to each letter on the chart.

4
00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:21.049
Job one: your child fills in the missing big letters. Job two: the missing small letters. The chart can help.

5
00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:25.822
The next page: color each big letter and its small partner the same color.
